===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|brǣw}}, {{m|ang|brēaw}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{m|gem-pro|*brēw-}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|wenkbrauw|(wenk)brauw}}, {{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|Braue}}. Apparently not related to {{m|en|brow}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|obsolete}} The [[eyelid]].
# {{label|en|obsolete}} The [[eyebrow]].

===Etymology 2===
{{unk.|en}} / uncertain origin.

